ed quiet-study floor at Scott Memorial Library.","evidence_claim":"Jefferson announced that Scott Memorial Library’s fourth floor is open for quiet study.","source_url":"https://www.jefferson.edu/academics/campus-libraries/library-news/2024/fourth-floor-reopens.html","source_title":"4th Floor Reopens at Scott Memorial Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2024-05-06","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The published notice directs users to access the floor via stairs while elevator service is restored.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"tju-gutman-library","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Paul J. Gutman Library","title":"Paul J. Gutman Library","subtitle":"East Falls Campus · 4201 Henry Avenue","notes":"Stop in for a quiet floor, group room, or librarian research help, and use the library’s East Falls location as a dependable study base.","short_summary":"The East Falls campus library offers quiet floors, group rooms, and research support.","evidence_claim":"Jefferson identifies Gutman Library as the East Falls campus library and directs visitors there for group study rooms, quiet floors, and librarian assistance.","source_url":"https://www.jefferson.edu/academics/campus-libraries.html","source_title":"Campus Libraries","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located on the East Falls Campus; consult the library’s reservation page for room eligibility.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"tju-gutman-study-room-101","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Gutman Library Study Room 101","title":"Gutman Study Room 101","subtitle":"Paul J. Gutman Library · East Falls Campus","notes":"Reserve Room 101 for a larger project group when a shared display helps; make one four-hour booking and avoid consecutive